<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Canadian oils.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Canadian oils.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Suncor Inc, adding it to the firm's recommended list, Imperial Oil Ltd with a market outperform rating and Petro-Canada Inc, also as a market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Todd Bergman was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- On the Toronto Stock Exchange, Suncor added 1.75 to 63, Imperial rose 0.10 to 62.35 and Petro-Canada increased 0.10 to 20.10.</p>
</text>
